<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Īdas</span></b> , ae, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴδας</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Son of Aphareus</i>, <i>king of
				Messene</i>, <i>who took part in the Calydonian
				boar-hunt</i>, <i><span class="en">Prop. 1, 2, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 8,
				305</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. F. 5, 701</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A companion of Diomedes</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 14,
				504</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>One slain in the wedding of Perseus</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 5,
			90</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>A Trojan</i>, <i>slain by Turnus</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				A. 9, 575</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>V.</b>
			<i>A Thracian</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A.
				10, 351</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
